but I did **not** consolidate them into `doc/speed.md`.

So `doc/speed.md` is currently **stale** relative to the final outputs. If you want, I can run a fresh timed end-to-end pass with Qwen on port 8080 and update the timing table, but it will take roughly 25–35 minutes for all prompts.

